{'symbol': 'MU', 'date': '2022-04-05 08:05:00', 'title': 'MICRON APPOINTS MARK MURPHY AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER', 'text': "BOISE, IDAHO, APRIL 05, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MICRON TECHNOLOGY, INC. (NASDAQ: MU), AN INDUSTRY LEADER IN INNOVATIVE MEMORY AND STORAGE SOLUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS APPOINTING MARK MURPHY AS THE COMPANY'S EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER EFFECTIVE APRIL 18, 2022.\xa0MURPHY BRINGS 25 YEARS OF DEEP FINANCIAL AND OPERATIONAL LEADERSHIP TO THE ROLE AND WILL OVERSEE MICRON'S FINANCIAL STRATEGY FOR THE COMPANY'S NEXT ERA OF GROWTH."}